Ponente (presentaciones orales y sesiones de pósteres) en AAAI (2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026), IJCAI (2019, 2021, 2022, 2024, 2025), KR (2018, 2020, 2024), ECAI (2020, 2023), AAMAS 2023, COMMA 2020, ACM SAC 2018 e IDEAS 2018. Ponente invitado en el 6th Madeira Workshop on Belief Revision, Argumentation, Ontologies, and Norms (2024).
